      "title": "Fix UI Freeze by Offloading Transcription to Background Thread",
      "summary": "### Summary\nThe application UI was freezing during long call transcriptions due to synchronous tasks blocking the UI thread.\n\n### Changes Made\n- Implemented asynchronous transcription processing by offloading tasks to a background thread.\n- Updated the UI to handle transcription results via callbacks, ensuring the main thread remains responsive.\n- Added error handling to manage potential issues during asynchronous processing.\n\n### Testing\n- Conducted manual testing with long sales calls to ensure the UI remains responsive.\n- Verified that transcription results are accurately reflected in the UI without delay.\n- Performed regression testing to ensure no other features were affected.",
